{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"临近圈, 消失圈"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"临近圈"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>相关笔记: "},{"Local":{"url":"nearby","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>一维复解析及平展情形</h3>\n<p><figure><img src=\"./临近圈-1.svg\" class=\"color-invert\"/></figure></p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>对象</th><th>复解析版本</th><th>"},{"Local":{"url":"平展景","text":"平展"}},{"Plain":"版本</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>$X$</td><td>复解析流形</td><td>概形</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$S$</td><td>圆盘或复解析 $\\mathbb A^1$</td><td>严格局部 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hensel环","text":"Hensel"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"离散赋值环","text":"DVR"}},{"Plain":" 的"},{"Local":{"url":"谱(代数)","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>原点</td><td>闭点</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$S^*$</td><td>去心圆盘</td><td>一般点</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$\\pi\\colon \\widetilde{S^*}\\to S^*$</td><td>"},{"Local":{"url":"万有覆叠","text":"万有覆叠"}},{"Plain":"</td><td>"},{"Local":{"url":"可分闭包","text":"可分闭包"}},{"Plain":"</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>基本群 / 覆叠变换群 $\\pi_1$</td><td>Galois 群</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>定义 $X$ 上的层 $F$ 的<strong>临近圈</strong> (nearby cycles) 为\n$$\r\nR\\Psi_f F = i^* R\\tilde j_* \\tilde j^* F,\r\n$$\n<strong>消失圈</strong> (vanishing cycles) 为\n$$\r\nR\\Phi_f F = \\operatorname{cofib}(i^*F \\to R\\Psi_f F),\r\n$$\n其中的映射来自伴随 $\\tilde j^* \\dashv R\\tilde j_*$ 的单位.</p>\n<h3>一般基底上的情形</h3>\n<p>意象的"},{"Local":{"url":"松拉回","text":"有向积"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}